 ["Group things by what they are made of","Say why we choose a material"],
 ("The school bag","Rani emptied her bag on the table: a steel box, a plastic bottle, a paper notebook, a cloth pouch and a wooden ruler.\n\"All different things,\" she said. \"Made of different materials.\""),
